### WD-1911 — Order/getList
# Órdenes por rango de fecha esperada (UTC, máximo 31 días) con promesa, cantidades,
# intento vigente y evaluación de servicio (isOnTime / isInFull).

### 1) Un día
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/getList
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-10-23T06:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-24T06:00:00Z"
}

### 2) Filtrado por estado y sucursal
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/getList
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-10-01T06:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-31T06:00:00Z",
  "orderStatusId": 3,
  "locationId": 9367
}

### 3) 400: rango de más de 31 días
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/getList
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-31T00:00:00Z"
}
